# LF everywhere, on every OS: .editorconfig and `dotnet format` enforce it in CI.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.webp binary
*.png binary
*.glb binary
*.opus binary
# The shared coordination docs (ARCHITECTURE §8 note 521): every agent appends to them (claims, Done rows, notes, logs), and
# two appends at once were a conflict to resolve by hand, nearly every merge. Union keeps both sides' lines; what it can't
# see (two claims of one number) tools/coord/check.py catches on the pull request.
docs/COORDINATION.md merge=union
docs/ARCHITECTURE.md merge=union
docs/log/*.md merge=union
